WEBVTT

00:10:29.162 --> 00:10:32.037
as breathing machines,
as lungs themselves.

00:10:36.496 --> 00:10:39.746
If we acknowledge and accept
the fact that, you know,

00:10:39.787 --> 00:10:42.621
buildings are basically allowing
us to breathe freely,

00:10:43.246 --> 00:10:46.787
then it really becomes a question
of rights that we have

00:10:46.996 --> 00:10:48.912
the basic human right to breathe.

00:10:49.662 --> 00:10:52.871
And we then can demand it in
our policies and our codes

00:10:52.871 --> 00:10:57.246
and demand that housing is better,
that with that demand,

00:10:57.246 --> 00:11:00.496
how could we allow prisons
to exist the way they do?